    "description": "<p>Only the mightiest adversaries deserve face-to-face confrontation with the Demon City. This Charm removes the range limit of its prerequisite, allowing Green Sun Nimbus Flare to augment physical attacks with bows and other distance weapons past point-blank range. Weapons not intended for use on a personal scale, such as Essence artillery, aren't compatible with Kissed By Hellish Noon by default, but Infernals with Essence 4+ may purchase the Charm a second time to enable this.</p>",
